        b638_q('b633-ree-math-discrete-economics','An alternative has lower present cost but also lower delivered service. What must be checked before choosing it?','Whether both alternatives satisfy the same required service level',['Only which has the lower first cost','Whether its name is shorter','Whether the discount rate is zero'],'Economic comparison is meaningful only after confirming alternatives meet comparable functional requirements.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','economic-alternative-service-equivalence','investment-choice','minimizes cost without checking functional adequacy',''),
