        b638_q('b633-ree-math-matrices-determinants','For compatible matrices A and B, does AB generally equal BA?','No; matrix multiplication is generally not commutative',['Yes, always','Only if both are square','Only when A is invertible'],'Order matters in matrix products; equality can occur in special cases but is not general.','D3','NON_NUMERICAL','matrix-order-dependence','state-space-model','assumes scalar multiplication rules apply unchanged',''),
        b638_q('b633-ree-math-matrices-determinants','A 2×2 system yields rows [1 0|2] and [0 0|1]. What does the second row imply?','The system is inconsistent',['x=2 is the unique solution','There are infinitely many solutions','The second variable is zero'],'The row states 0=1, a contradiction.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','inconsistent-row-detection','equation-diagnosis','ignores a zero-coefficient contradiction',''),
        b638_q('b633-ree-math-sequences-series','A periodic process has period 0.02 s. What is its frequency?','50 Hz',['20 Hz','0.02 Hz','100 Hz'],'Frequency is reciprocal of period: 1/0.02=50 Hz.','D3','CALCULATION_REQUIRED','period-frequency-reciprocal','periodic-signal','multiplies period by 100 instead of taking reciprocal','1/.02=50Hz'),
