        b638_q('b633-ree-math-fourier-laplace','A periodic signal is even about t=0. Which Fourier coefficient family vanishes under the standard symmetric interval?','Sine coefficients',['Cosine coefficients','The DC coefficient always','All coefficients'],'An even signal has zero sine coefficients because sine is odd and the symmetric integral cancels.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','even-function-fourier-symmetry','harmonic-decomposition','reverses even/odd coefficient rules',''),
