        b638_q('b633-ree-math-fourier-laplace','A Fourier series represents a periodic waveform with a jump. At the jump, to what value does the series converge?','The average of the left- and right-hand limits',['Always the left-hand value','Always the right-hand value','The peak value'],'At a jump discontinuity the Fourier series converges to the midpoint of the one-sided limits.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','fourier-jump-convergence','waveform-reconstruction','expects pointwise convergence to one side',''),
