        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-control-systems','A controller has integral windup while the actuator is saturated. What implementation feature can help?','Anti-windup logic',['Higher integral gain only','Removing output limits from the display','Random reset timing'],'Anti-windup limits or back-calculates the integrator when the actuator cannot follow the command.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','integrator-windup-control','actuator-saturation','assumes the integrator can command beyond physical actuator limits',''),
        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-control-systems','A sampled controller uses period Ts=0.01 s. What is its sampling frequency?','100 Hz',['0.01 Hz','10 Hz','1,000 Hz'],'fs=1/Ts=1/0.01=100 Hz.','D3','CALCULATION_REQUIRED','sample-period-frequency','digital-control','multiplies sampling period and frequency','1/.01=100Hz'),
        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-power-electronics','An ideal boost converter has Vin=20 V and duty ratio D=0.2. What is Vout in continuous conduction?','25 V',['16 V','24 V','100 V'],'Vout=Vin/(1−D)=20/0.8=25 V.','D3','CALCULATION_REQUIRED','boost-duty-output','dc-conversion','uses buck duty relation','20/(1-.2)=25V'),
        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-power-electronics','A flyback converter transfers energy primarily during which switch interval in its basic operation?','When the primary switch is off and secondary path conducts',['Only while the switch is an ideal short','Only at zero output voltage','Continuously through a direct transformer connection'],'The coupled inductor stores energy during switch-on and transfers it to the secondary after turn-off.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','flyback-energy-transfer-interval','isolated-converter','models a flyback as an ordinary continuously coupled transformer',''),
