        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-telecommunications','A channel has bandwidth 3 kHz and symbol rate 2 kbaud. Is the symbol rate necessarily impossible?','No; feasibility depends on modulation and channel shaping',['Yes, symbol rate must equal bandwidth','Yes, bit rate is always twice bandwidth','No channel can exceed 1 baud'],'Nyquist signaling limits depend on channel bandwidth and pulse shaping; bandwidth and symbol rate are not identical quantities.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','bandwidth-symbol-rate-distinction','digital-channel','equates bandwidth with symbol rate without modulation assumptions',''),
