        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-telecommunications','A pulse train has timing jitter. Which receiver task is most directly affected?','Symbol-clock recovery and sampling instant',['The DC resistance of the antenna','The number of transmitted bits','The propagation speed in a vacuum'],'Timing uncertainty can move sampling away from the optimum symbol instant.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','timing-jitter-sampling','digital-reception','confuses timing error with carrier amplitude',''),
        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-telecommunications','An antenna mismatch reflects part of the incident power. What happens to delivered load power compared with a matched case?','It is reduced by the reflected fraction',['It necessarily doubles','It is independent of reflection','All reflected power becomes useful load power'],'Mismatch reduces net power accepted by the load; the fraction depends on reflection coefficient.','D3','CONCEPTUAL_QUANTITATIVE','impedance-mismatch-power','radio-interface','assumes reflected energy is delivered to the load',''),
        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-computer-power-applications','A grid model uses an old topology snapshot. What risk affects contingency conclusions?','Outages and overloads may be evaluated on a network that no longer exists',['The solver automatically updates topology','Only output formatting is affected','The power-flow equations become unnecessary'],'Contingency results depend on the represented network and status at the study time.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','stale-topology-study','model-currentness','treats network configuration as static without confirmation',''),
        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-computer-power-applications','A program stores 32-bit floating-point voltage magnitude. Why should precision be considered in iterative calculations?','Rounding can affect convergence and small differences',['Floating point has no rounding','Precision controls physical voltage','More bits remove model error'],'Finite precision can affect numerical iteration, but does not resolve uncertainty or model error.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','floating-point-precision-limit','numerical-computation','equates numerical precision with physical accuracy',''),
        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-computer-power-applications','A study report omits the base case and contingency definition. What is the main weakness?','Results cannot be independently reproduced or interpreted',['The calculations necessarily become wrong','The case is more secure','The number of buses changes'],'Inputs and event definitions are essential context for reproducing and interpreting a power-system study.','D3','NON_NUMERICAL','study-report-reproducibility','engineering-documentation','assumes an output table is sufficient without model context',''),
