        b638_q('b633-ree-pro-computer-power-applications','A model is calibrated on one operating regime and used at a very different loading point. What should be assessed?','Whether its assumptions and validation range cover the new regime',['Only the graph title','The code editor theme','Whether the old result had many decimals'],'Extrapolation beyond the model’s validated range can make predictions unreliable.','D4','NON_NUMERICAL','model-domain-extrapolation','simulation-use','assumes calibration guarantees validity everywhere',''),
